  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.2.0:\n\n## Added\n- `CodePointFlags.HalfWidthSpace` enum member: Indicates that a code point is a half-width space. (DOC-7903)\n- A CycloneDX software bill of materials (SBOM) is now included in the NuGet package, with a separate SBOM for each target framework. (DOC-7727)\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where `Image.FromStream` threw an exception when loading images whose EXIF metadata referenced data beyond the end of the image stream. (DOC-7806)\n- Fixed an issue where half-width spaces were drawn incorrectly in vertical text when `TextFormat.UprightInVerticalText` was set to true. (DOC-7903)",
